  "label": "Meme Culture Enthusiasts",
  "description": "The meme is designed for individuals familiar with internet meme culture, who understand the conventions of shock humor and absurd juxtaposition. The target audience appreciates the incongruity between the historical gravitas of Adolf Hitler and the mundane event of a bird flying by, which is a hallmark of meme-based satire. This audience is likely to find the humor in the grotesque incongruity and the sarcastic tone, even if it is offensive to others.",
